A layout chooses between two parallel route slots by role:

```tsx
export default async function Layout({ admin, user }) {
  const role = await checkUserRole()
  return role === 'admin' ? admin : user
}
```

`@admin/page.tsx` loads sensitive statistics. What is the security problem?

A data function catches every error so that it can log it:

```ts
async function getPost(slug: string) {
  try {
    const post = await db.post.find(slug)
    if (!post) notFound()
    return post
  } catch (err) {
    console.error(err)
    return null
  }
}
```

For a missing post, the page renders an empty article instead of the not-found UI. Why?
